<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/14/eng@/~cl_15> <https://schema.org/name> "The Federal Constitution is amended by substituting"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/14/eng@/~cl_15> <https://schema.org/text> "for Article 122A the following Article: 122A. (1) The Court of Appeal shall consist of a chairman (to be styled the \"President of the Court of Appeal\") and, until the Yang di-Pertuan Agong by order otherwise provides of ten other judges."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/14/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/14/eng@/~cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/14/eng@> .
