<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/14/eng@/~cl_29__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A person seconded under this Article shall remain a member of the service to which he belongs, but his remuneration shall be paid by the Federation, State, authority or organisation, as the case may be, to whose service he is seconded.\". BILL"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/14/eng@> .
